Z||000016||sluppy123||07-30-2001||10:51 PM||||Here's a list of everything I used, and a total cost.  Keep in mind I did all the work so labor was not a factor, Just my spare time. About 5 weeks start to finish, 2-3 hours a night during the week and 5-6 hours on the weekend. And all the material for the mounts I already had.<P>MSD BTM- $320<BR>MSD wiring harness $28<BR>Holley Adj Fuel pressure reg- $80<BR>Holley rising rate fuel pressure reg- $200<BR>Autometer Ultra-lite boost gauge- $43<BR>Autometer Ultra-lite Air/Fuel Gauge- $50<BR>3ft of braided Steel hose, oil return- $18<BR>High temp silicon tubing- $45<BR>Gauge pod- $28<BR>Stainless steel tubing, for exhaust- $50<BR>Misc stuff from the harware store- $40<P>Total $902<P>||||reg||1
