Z||000024||sluppy123||08-16-2001||10:49 PM||||The turbo itself was only $25, plus $75 for the rebuild kit. Forgot that on my list.<P>The Turbo on the 3.8 is a little big for the 2.8, Even the T3 I have spools up a little slow,But As soon as the RPM's climb above 2500 it's pull like a freight train. When I go to a 3.4 it should be just fine.<P>No times yet, still doing some tuning. <P>As far as the Air filter is concerned, It mounts on the inlet side of the turbo. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=13494839&p=53027852&Sequence=0"> <P>Yea I'll be at the Dells 2002, Can't wait.<BR>||||reg||1
